# ═══ Feature stages (kit.notes.md 2026-10-19 08:23Z) ═════════════════════════
# "a board view which enforces the feature creation pipeline. Let's make this
# separate from the existing board for now and we can unify them later if it
# makes sense before public release". Ids are STAGE, not PIPELINE: snip-it.beh
# already has a FEAT-PIPELINE for its video board, and one word meaning two
# boards a corpus apart is the trap the BEH-UI note above describes.
#
# A feature's stage lives in the corpus as `stage <problem|ux|logic|development|ui>`
# under its `feature` line: a corpus LANGUAGE change (claude-code-bot#58), which he
# approved on BEH-STAGE-1 at 2026-10-19 13:39Z. Built: BEH-STAGE-1, -3 and -8. Still
# pending: the agent's halves (BEH-STAGE-2's reading, -5, -6).

feature FEAT-STAGES "Feature stages"
  stage development

